Subject: [PATCH] Settle native image decode waiters where ImageLoader settles decode promises

An already complete image settles a native waiter in a queued task, not a microtask: a host
that disallows VM entry never performs a microtask checkpoint.

diff --git a/Source/WebCore/html/HTMLImageElement.cpp b/Source/WebCore/html/HTMLImageElement.cpp
--- a/Source/WebCore/html/HTMLImageElement.cpp
+++ b/Source/WebCore/html/HTMLImageElement.cpp
@@ -835,6 +835,11 @@
     return m_imageLoader->decode(WTF::move(promise));
 }
 
+void HTMLImageElement::decode(Function<void(ImageDecodeResult)>&& waiter)
+{
+    m_imageLoader->decode(WTF::move(waiter));
+}
+
 void HTMLImageElement::addSubresourceAttributeURLs(OrderedHashSet<URL>& urls) const
 {
     HTMLElement::addSubresourceAttributeURLs(urls);
